      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.551025390625,
        337.7593688964844,
        99.2790298461914
      ],
      "text": "Management of the neonate with TB disease",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        106.29052734375,
        513.483642578125,
        119.64202880859375
      ],
      "text": "The treatment of congenital TB and neonatal TB is the same and should be carried out",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        122.28704833984375,
        513.3914184570312,
        135.6385498046875
      ],
      "text": "by a clinician experienced in the management of paediatric TB. A complete investigation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        138.2835693359375,
        513.3915405273438,
        151.63507080078125
      ],
      "text": "of mother and neonate should be undertaken. Chest X-rays should be done and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        154.28009033203125,
        513.4259643554688,
        167.631591796875
      ],
      "text": "specimens collected from appropriate sites to confirm the diagnosis of TB in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        170.276611328125,
        513.4720458984375,
        183.62811279296875
      ],
      "text": "neonate. Treatment should be started on suspicion, while bacteriological confirmation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        186.27313232421875,
        513.3915405273438,
        199.6246337890625
      ],
      "text": "is awaited, as TB progresses rapidly in the neonate. Standard WHO-recommended drug",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        202.2696533203125,
        513.471923828125,
        215.62115478515625
      ],
      "text": "regimens for drug-susceptible and drug-resistant TB are used – see Chapters 4 and 7.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        218.26617431640625,
        513.3568725585938,
        231.61767578125
      ],
      "text": "Drug dosages must take account of body weight and of weight gain, which can be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        234.2626953125,
        513.4375610351562,
        247.61419677734375
      ],
      "text": "rapid in young infants. Pharmacokinetic data to inform appropriate dosages of anti-TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        250.25921630859375,
        444.7593688964844,
        263.6107177734375
      ],
      "text": "drugs in neonates, especially preterm neonates, are currently very limited.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        274.76568603515625,
        513.4375610351562,
        288.1171875
      ],
      "text": "A favourable response to therapy is indicated by increased appetite, weight gain and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        290.76220703125,
        513.4143676757812,
        304.11370849609375
      ],
      "text": "radiographic resolution. Breastfeeding is recommended, irrespective of the TB status of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        306.75872802734375,
        513.3800659179688,
        320.1102294921875
      ],
      "text": "the mother; the risk of TB transmission through breast milk is negligible and, although",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        322.7552185058594,
        513.3683471679688,
        336.1067199707031
      ],
      "text": "the most commonly used anti-TB drugs are excreted into breast milk in small amounts,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        338.751708984375,
        513.4374389648438,
        352.10321044921875
      ],
      "text": "there is no evidence that this induces drug resistance. Separation from the mother is not",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        354.7481994628906,
        513.426025390625,
        368.0997009277344
      ],
      "text": "advised, especially in resource-limited settings where establishing breastfeeding can be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        370.74468994140625,
        513.36865234375,
        384.09619140625
      ],
      "text": "critical for child survival. However, when TB is suspected or confirmed in the mother of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        386.7411804199219,
        513.4374389648438,
        400.0926818847656
      ],
      "text": "an acutely ill neonate, the mother and her baby should be separated from the neonatal",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        402.7376708984375,
        458.01898193359375,
        416.08917236328125
      ],
      "text": "unit as soon as possible to prevent other neonates contracting the infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        428.95892333984375,
        321.7513732910156,
        445.6869201660156
      ],
      "text": "Integration of maternal/infant TB/HIV care",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        452.69842529296875,
        513.3915405273438,
        466.0499267578125
      ],
      "text": "National tuberculosis programmes, in particular in settings with a high burden of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        468.6949157714844,
        513.4030151367188,
        482.0464172363281
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis and HIV, should reach out to maternal, neonatal, and child health care",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        484.69140625,
        513.4376220703125,
        498.04290771484375
      ],
      "text": "services to ensure the mainstreaming of tuberculosis prevention, diagnosis and treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        500.618896484375,
        513.4028930664062,
        514.0394287109375
      ],
      "text": "(11) . Table 12 includes key actions suggested to address the impact of tuberculosis on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        516.6843872070312,
        513.4490966796875,
        530.035888671875
      ],
      "text": "maternal, neonatal, and child health through integrating tuberculosis prevention and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        532.6118774414062,
        171.08241271972656,
        546.0323486328125
      ],
      "text": "(11) care services  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "82",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
